notes.content:
Hi! The BIG patch is here!

[b]Added the ability to play in any resolution;[/b]
Completely reworked computer screens and VHS episodes;
Removed the alarm clock in the scientist's office;
The letter "i" near objects became fatter;
Removed incorrectly working shaders;
Fixed bug with audio cassette;
Correction of typos in Russian and English versions.

We apologize to those who lost their saves due to the patch, but, unfortunately, it was impossible to do otherwise. We are very sorry!

Thank you for your attention!

Hi!

Mini-patch №2 is here.

* Added the ability to make screenshots on Steam;
* Fixed some phrases and dialogues;
* The game has become more friendly for streams and YouTube-videos;
* Fixed some typos and errors;

We apologize to those who lost their saves due to the patch, but, unfortunately, it was impossible to do otherwise. We are very sorry!

Thank you for your attention.
